is quite common among the organization's personnel, so please proceed with your duties without concern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480500/extras/e5a344f77650a1fa494eba9e8a061238.avif?t=1742334768\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winged Girl &quot;Sera&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first anomaly you encounter, a girl with wings. She was rescued from being held as an &quot;important research subject&quot; in a certain organization's facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480500/extras/d67d43205e2a9ebbea246a343652b758.avif?t=1742334768\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
